// Builtin spellings and program functions (docs/205 R7).
//
// A top-level function declared in the program owns its spelling over a
// builtin or stdlib operation, as a local value and a user class already do.
// The callable table seeds only the builtin rows no such function claims, so
// the program row is the one every later lookup of that spelling finds.
//
// The spellings below are the exception, and a top-level function may not
// take them. The rows are src/semantic/builtin_name_reservation.def projected
// one to one; the ambient-capability family is the capability registry.
import "ast_signature_fact_owner.pgy";
import "builtin_signature_owner.pgy";
import "builtin_capability_projection_owner.pgy";
import "diagnostic_owner.pgy";

